{"suttaId":"tha-ap24","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[2670,2835],"vripara":"52"},"segments":{"tha-ap24:0.3":"Upavānattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap24:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap24:1.3":"Jalitvā aggikkhandhova, sambuddho parinibbuto.","tha-ap24:2.1":"“Mahājanā samāgamma, pūjayitvā tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap24:2.3":"Citaṃ katvāna sukataṃ, sarīraṃ abhiropayuṃ.","tha-ap24:3.1":"“Sarīrakiccaṃ katvāna, dhātuṃ tattha samānayuṃ;","tha-ap24:3.3":"Sadevamānusā sabbe, buddhathūpaṃ akaṃsu te.","tha-ap24:4.1":"“Paṭhamā kañcanamayā, dutiyāsi maṇīmayā;","tha-ap24:4.3":"Tatiyā rūpiyamayā, catutthī phalikāmayā.","tha-ap24:5.1":"“Tathā [tattha (syā. ka.)] pañcamiyā bhūmi [nemi (sī.)], lohitaṅgamayā ahu;","tha-ap24:5.3":"Chaṭṭhā masāragallassa, sabbaratanamayūpari.","tha-ap24:6.1":"“Jaṅghā maṇimayā āsi, vedikā ratanamayā;","tha-ap24:6.3":"Sabbasoṇṇamayo thūpo, uddhaṃ yojanamuggato.","tha-ap24:7.1":"“Devā tattha samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:7.3":"Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino.","tha-ap24:8.1":"“Dhātu āveṇikā natthi, sarīraṃ ekapiṇḍitaṃ;","tha-ap24:8.3":"Imamhi buddhathūpamhi, kassāma kañcukaṃ mayaṃ.","tha-ap24:9.1":"“Devā sattahi ratnehi [sattaratanehi (sī.)], aññaṃ vaḍḍhesu yojanaṃ;","tha-ap24:9.3":"Thūpo dviyojanubbedho, timiraṃ byapahanti so.","tha-ap24:10.1":"“Nāgā tattha samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:10.3":"Manussā ceva devā ca, buddhathūpaṃ akaṃsu te.","tha-ap24:11.1":"“Mā no pamattā assumha [assumhā (sī. syā.), āsimhā (?)], appamattā sadevakā;","tha-ap24:11.3":"Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino.","tha-ap24:12.1":"“Indanīlaṃ mahānīlaṃ, atho jotirasaṃ maṇiṃ;","tha-ap24:12.3":"Ekato sannipātetvā, buddhathūpaṃ achādayuṃ.","tha-ap24:13.1":"“Sabbaṃ maṇimayaṃ āsi, tāvatā buddhacetiyaṃ;","tha-ap24:13.3":"Tiyojanasamubbiddhaṃ [tīṇi yojanamubbiddhaṃ (sī. ka.)], ālokakaraṇaṃ tadā.","tha-ap24:14.1":"“Garuḷā ca samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:14.3":"Manussā devā nāgā ca, buddhathūpaṃ akaṃsu te.","tha-ap24:15.1":"“‘Mā no pamattā assumha, appamattā sadevakā;","tha-ap24:15.3":"Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino’.","tha-ap24:16.1":"“Sabbaṃ maṇimayaṃ thūpaṃ, akaruṃ te ca kañcukaṃ [sabbamaṇimayaṃ thūpe, akaruttarakañcukaṃ (sī.)];","tha-ap24:16.3":"Yojanaṃ tepi vaḍḍhesuṃ, āyataṃ buddhacetiyaṃ.","tha-ap24:17.1":"“Catuyojanamubbiddho, buddhathūpo virocati;","tha-ap24:17.3":"Obhāseti disā sabbā, sataraṃsīva uggato.","tha-ap24:18.1":"“Kumbhaṇḍā ca samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:18.3":"Manussā ceva devā ca, nāgā ca garuḷā tathā.","tha-ap24:18.5":"Paccekaṃ buddhaseṭṭhassa, akaṃsu thūpamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap24:19.1":"“‘Mā no pamattā assumha, appamattā sadevakā;","tha-ap24:19.3":"Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino;","tha-ap24:19.5":"Ratanehi chādessāma, āyataṃ buddhacetiyaṃ’.","tha-ap24:20.1":"“Yojanaṃ tepi vaḍḍhesuṃ, āyataṃ buddhacetiyaṃ;","tha-ap24:20.3":"Pañcayojanamubbiddho, thūpo obhāsate tadā.","tha-ap24:21.1":"“Yakkhā tattha samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:21.3":"Manussā devā nāgā ca, garuḷā kumbhaaṇḍakā.","tha-ap24:22.1":"“Paccekaṃ buddhaseṭṭhassa, akaṃsu thūpamuttamaṃ;","tha-ap24:22.3":"‘Mā no pamattā assumha, appamattā sadevakā.","tha-ap24:23.1":"“‘Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino;","tha-ap24:23.3":"Phalikāhi chādessāma, āyataṃ buddhacetiyaṃ’.","tha-ap24:24.1":"“Yojanaṃ tepi vaḍḍhesuṃ, āyataṃ buddhacetiyaṃ;","tha-ap24:24.3":"Cha yojanāni ubbiddho, thūpo obhāsate tadā.","tha-ap24:25.1":"“Gandhabbā ca samāgantvā, ekato mantayuṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:25.3":"‘Manujā devatā nāgā, garuḷā kumbhayakkhakā.","tha-ap24:26.1":"“‘Sabbekaṃsu buddhathūpaṃ, mayamettha akārakā;","tha-ap24:26.3":"Mayampi thūpaṃ kassāma, lokanāthassa tādino’.","tha-ap24:27.1":"“Vediyo satta katvāna, chattamāropayiṃsu te;","tha-ap24:27.3":"Sabbasoṇṇamayaṃ thūpaṃ, gandhabbā kārayuṃ tadā.","tha-ap24:28.1":"“Sattayojanamubbiddho, thūpo obhāsate tadā;","tha-ap24:28.3":"Rattindivā na ñāyanti, āloko hoti [ālokā honti (syā. ka.)] sabbadā.","tha-ap24:29.1":"“Abhibhonti na tassābhā, candasūrā satārakā;","tha-ap24:29.3":"Samantā yojanasate, padīpopi na pajjali.","tha-ap24:30.1":"“Tena kālena ye keci, thūpaṃ pūjenti mānusā;","tha-ap24:30.3":"Na te thūpamāruhanti, ambare ukkhipanti te.","tha-ap24:31.1":"“Devehi ṭhapito yakkho, abhisammatanāmako;","tha-ap24:31.3":"Dhajaṃ vā pupphadāmaṃ vā, abhiropeti uttari.","tha-ap24:32.1":"“Na te passanti taṃ yakkhaṃ, dāmaṃ passanti gacchato;","tha-ap24:32.3":"Evaṃ passitvā gacchantā, sabbe gacchanti suggatiṃ.","tha-ap24:33.1":"“Viruddhā [visaddhā (sī.)] ye pāvacane, pasannā ye ca sāsane;","tha-ap24:33.3":"Pāṭiheraṃ daṭṭhukāmā, thūpaṃ pūjenti mānusā.","tha-ap24:34.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, ahosiṃ bhatako [varako (syā. ka.)] tadā;","tha-ap24:34.3":"Āmoditaṃ janaṃ disvā, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap24:35.1":"“‘Uḷāro bhagavā heso, yassa dhātudharedisaṃ;","tha-ap24:35.3":"Imā ca janatā tuṭṭhā, kāraṃ kubbaṃ na tappare [kubbantanappakaṃ (sī.)].","tha-ap24:36.1":"“‘Ahampi kāraṃ kassāmi, lokanāthassa tādino;","tha-ap24:36.3":"Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, bhavissāmi anāgate’.","tha-ap24:37.1":"“Sudhotaṃ rajakenāhaṃ, uttareyyapaṭaṃ mama;","tha-ap24:37.3":"Veḷagge ālagetvāna, dhajaṃ ukkhipimambare.","tha-ap24:38.1":"“Abhisammatako gayha, ambarehāsi me dhajaṃ;","tha-ap24:38.3":"Vāteritaṃ dhajaṃ disvā, bhiyyo hāsaṃ janesahaṃ.","tha-ap24:39.1":"“Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, samaṇaṃ upasaṅkamiṃ;","tha-ap24:39.3":"Taṃ bhikkhuṃ abhivādetvā, vipākaṃ pucchahaṃ dhaje.","tha-ap24:40.1":"“So me kathesi ānanda, pītisañjananaṃ mama;","tha-ap24:40.3":"‘Tassa dhajassa vipākaṃ, anubhossasi sabbadā.","tha-ap24:41.1":"“‘Hatthī assā rathā pattī, senā ca caturaṅginī;","tha-ap24:41.3":"Parivāressanti taṃ niccaṃ, dhajadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap24:42.1":"“‘Saṭṭhitūriyasahassāni, bheriyo samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap24:42.3":"Parivāressanti taṃ niccaṃ, dhajadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap24:43.1":"“‘Chaḷāsītisahassāni, nāriyo samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap24:43.3":"Vicittavatthābharaṇā, āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā.","tha-ap24:44.1":"“‘Aḷārapamhā hasulā, susaññā tanumajjhimā;","tha-ap24:44.3":"Parivāressanti taṃ niccaṃ, dhajadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap24:45.1":"“‘Tiṃsakappasahassāni, devaloke ramissasi;","tha-ap24:45.3":"Asītikkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjaṃ karissasi.","tha-ap24:46.1":"“‘Sahassakkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī bhavissasi;","tha-ap24:46.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap24:47.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap24:47.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap24:48.1":"“‘Devalokā cavitvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap24:48.3":"Puññakammena saṃyutto, brahmabandhu bhavissasi.","tha-ap24:49.1":"“‘Asītikoṭiṃ chaḍḍetvā, dāse kammakare bahū;","tha-ap24:49.3":"Gotamassa bhagavato, sāsane pabbajissasi.","tha-ap24:50.1":"“‘Ārādhayitvā sambuddhaṃ, gotamaṃ sakyapuṅgavaṃ;","tha-ap24:50.3":"Upavānoti nāmena, hessasi satthu sāvako’.","tha-ap24:51.1":"“Satasahasse kataṃ kammaṃ, phalaṃ dassesi me idha;","tha-ap24:51.3":"Sumutto saravegova kilese jhāpayī mama.","tha-ap24:52.1":"“Cakkavattissa santassa, catudīpissarassa me;","tha-ap24:52.3":"Tiyojanāni samantā, ussīsanti dhajā sadā.","tha-ap24:53.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap24:53.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dhajadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap24:54.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap24:54.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap24:55.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā upavāno thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap24:56.1":"Upavānattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2346,"to":2348,"paras":[{"para":2346,"vripara":"52","refs":["tha-ap24:1"],"words":["padumuttaro nāma jino","pāragū","jalitvā","parinibbuto","sambuddho"],"lines":["Evaṃ so pattaarahattaphalo adhigataetadaggaṭṭhāno attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassavasena pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha sabbesaṃ lokiyalokuttaradhammānaṃ <b>pāragū</b> pariyosānaṃ nibbānaṃ gato patto <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b> jitapañcamāro bhagavā aggikkhandho iva chabbaṇṇā buddharaṃsiyo <b>jalitvā</b> sabbalokaṃ dhammapajjotena obhāsetvā <b>sambuddho</b> suṭṭhu buddho avijjāniddūpagatāya pajāya savāsanāya kilesaniddāya paṭibuddho vikasitanettapaṅkajo <b>parinibbuto</b> khandhaparinibbānena nibbuto adassanaṃ gatoti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap24:1"],["tha-ap24:1"]]},{"para":2347,"vripara":"57","refs":["tha-ap24:6"],"words":["jaṅghā"],"lines":["<b>Jaṅghā</b>ti cetiyakaraṇakāle upacinitabbānaṃ iṭṭhakānaṃ ṭhapanatthāya, nibandhiyamānasopānapanti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap24:6"]]},{"para":2348,"vripara":"88","refs":["tha-ap24:37"],"words":["sudhotaṃ rajakenāhaṃ","uttareyyapaṭaṃ mama","ambare"],"lines":["<b>Sudhotaṃ rajakenāhan</b>ti vatthadhovakena purisena suṭṭhu dhovitaṃ suvisuddhakataṃ, <b>uttareyyapaṭaṃ mama</b> uttarasāṭakaṃ ahaṃ veḷagge laggitvā dhajaṃ katvā ukkhipiṃ, <b>ambare</b> ākāse ussāpesinti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap24:37"],["tha-ap24:37"]]}]},"tika":null}
